# Everything in this repository is consumed by Linux tooling at some point: the
# Dockerfile and post-create script run inside the container, and Prettier is
# configured with endOfLine: lf. Checking out CRLF on Windows would break the
# shell script and the Dockerfile's line continuations, so pin the working tree
# to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
